NB: the only relevant www directory is SFT.
the directory SFTschool contains only webpages of schools till 2022. 
#####################################################################

The last edition of SFT school with its own, indepedent, web page is
2021.

Starting from SFT-2022 the only web page is that on GGI website.

The directories SFT_2014, ... , SFT_2021, contains the sources of the
various webpages.

The directories SFT_2022, ... , are devoted to, and contains only
lecture notes and bonus material.

Thus, starting from 2022, only active files are
Practical_body.html  and Previous_body.html .